flowchart TB
  O[Mac orchestrator<br/>Plan · contracts · dispatch<br/>Verify advice · own decisions<br/>Review · integrate · publish]
  W1[Mac worker 1<br/>1..N independent Codex CLI sessions<br/>Isolated checkouts + owned files]
  W2[Mac worker 2<br/>1..N independent Codex CLI sessions<br/>Isolated checkouts + owned files]
  W3[Linux ARM worker 3<br/>1..N independent Codex CLI sessions<br/>Isolated checkouts + owned files]
  A[Optional expert advisor<br/>Example: Claude Fable 5.2<br/>Read-only critique or diagnosis<br/>No edits, dispatch, or integration]
  C[Consult only for a user-requested plan review<br/>OR when worker AND orchestrator cannot solve the issue]
  G[GitHub<br/>Reviewed project history<br/>Required review and merge gate]
  T[Optional test targets<br/>VM · GPU · service · device<br/>Explicit owner and authorization]
  O -->|Verified SSH + fresh bounded brief| W1
  O -->|Verified SSH + fresh bounded brief| W2
  O -->|Verified SSH + fresh bounded brief| W3
  W1 -->|Changes + original logs + closure evidence| O
  W2 -->|Changes + original logs + closure evidence| O
  W3 -->|Changes + original logs + closure evidence| O
  O -.->|Focused brief + evidence| A
  A -.->|Written advice for orchestrator to verify| O
  C -.- A
  O -->|Reviewed publication| G
  O -->|Serial shared resource gate| T
  classDef orchestrator fill:#eaf0ff,stroke:#4261b9,color:#172644
  classDef worker fill:#e9f7f4,stroke:#208c80,color:#153e39
  classDef target fill:#f3edfb,stroke:#8c68b3,color:#423050
  classDef advisor fill:#fff3db,stroke:#ad7420,color:#63430f
  class O orchestrator
  class W1,W2,W3 worker
  class G,T target
  class A,C advisor
